  fullText: 'The temperature is getting unbearable. We are being forced to retreat

    deeper
    and deeper as the water evaporates at unbelievable speeds.

    Proima has never
    lived through something like this before. All the

    natural disasters that
    hit this planet can not compare to this. I just hope

    we actually get to
    live through it.

    All the research I have done has been useless. I am scared
    mom.'
